      },
      {
        "text": "One might conflate the reserve balance rate (4.65 percent) with the upper bound of the target range (4-3/4 percent) or the primary credit rate (4.75 percent); the sources show they are separate decisions — the IORB is set by the Board of Governors at 4.65 percent, while the discount (primary credit) rate was separately raised to 4.75 percent.",
        "kind": "model_interpretation",
